kylin-wlcom(1)

# NAME

kylin-wlcom - Default Wayland compositor for Kylin OS

# SYNOPSIS

*kylin-wlcom* [options] [command]

# DESCRIPTION

kylin-wlcom is the default Wayland compositor for Kylin OS, providing
a modern and secure display server for the desktop environment.

# OPTIONS

*-h*, *--help*
	Show help message and exit.

*-d*, *--debug*
	Enable full logging, including debug information.

*-s*, *--session* <process>
	Run session on startup.

*-v*, *--version*
	Show version number and exit.

*-V*, *--verbose*
	Enable more verbose logging.

